{comment: Intro}
[Dm]      [Bb]      [F]     [C]

{comment: Verse 1}
{ci: (solo)}
Hear our [Dm]cry be lifted [Bb]high in this [F]place[C]
Lord we want [Dm]you   no one else will [Bb]do   in this [F]place[C]
{ci: (repeat all unison)}

{comment: Chorus}
{ci: (parts)}
[C]Chains are [F]broken    eyes are [C/E]o-pened    Mira[Dm7]cles are in this [Bb]place
Hearts are [F]mended,  grace ex[C/E]tended      Mira[Dm7]cles -  are in this [Bb]place

{comment: Bridge 1}
{ci: (solo)}
A [F]miracle can happen     a [C/E]miracle can happen
A [Dm7]miracle can happen in this [Bb]place
A [F]miracle can happen      a [C/E]miracle can happen
A [Dm7]miracle can happen in this [Bb]place
{ci: (repeat all unison)}
{ci: (repeat parts)}

{comment: Bridge 2}
{ci: (flipped parts)}
With [F]Jesus it will happen   With [C/E]Jesus it will happen
With [Dm7]Jesus it will happen in this [Bb]place
With [F]Jesus it will happen   with [C/E]Jesus it will happen
With [Dm7]Jesus it will happen in this [Bb]place
{ci: Chorus (parts flip up)}
